Subject: [PATCH 07/12] US-21: contain failed training jobs (MLE-NF-006)

Run training in a spawned child process with a time limit, a scratch folder
and a result file; promote the model only on success. Add fault injection
(crash, hang, exception, MemoryError, partial write) and stale-run recovery.

